## Case (ck.db AWPTCM-T22651)
Objective: retrieve sensor information and compare with `show system environment` (float
readings are big-endian). Steps: 1 read 0x1000 #1 Sensor Type (1 word ENUM); 2 read 0x1001 #1
Sensor Reading (2 words Float); 3 read 0x1003 #1 Sensor Units (1 word ENUM); 4 read 0x1004 #1
Sensor Fault Status (1 word UINT); 5 repeat from 0x1005 for sensor #2.
Register semantics (ART library_1359 / test-1359.1001 TestCase_110, same 5-word layout):
per member (unit id), 5 words per sensor from 0x1000: type, reading (float, 2 words), units,
status (0 = Ok, else FAULT); a Closed/Open or No/Yes CLI reading maps to 0.0 / non-zero.

