  step 2  READ 0x1001 x2 FLOAT -> words=['0x422c','0x0000'] value=43.0     = CLI "Temp: System (Degrees C) 43"
  step 3  READ 0x1003 x1 ENUM  -> words=['0x0002'] value=2                 units code 2 (Degrees C; the only sensor with units in the CLI)
  step 4  READ 0x1004 x1 UINT  -> words=['0x0000'] value=0                 = CLI Status "Ok"
  step 5  READ 0x1005 x1 ENUM  -> words=['0x000b'] value=11                sensor #2 type 11 (LED Output)
          READ 0x1006 x2 FLOAT -> words=['0x0000','0x0000'] value=0.0      = CLI "Almmon: LED Output No"
          READ 0x1008 x1 ENUM  -> words=['0x0000'] value=0                 no units (CLI shows none)
          READ 0x1009 x1 UINT  -> words=['0x0000'] value=0                 = CLI "Ok"
  whole block READ 0x1000 x25 RAW ->
      [2, 0x422c 0x0000 (43.0), 2, 0 | 11, 0.0, 0, 0 | 10, 0x3f80 0x0000 (1.0), 0, 0 | 7, 1.0, 0, 0 | 7, 0.0, 0, 0]
      = sensor 3 type 10 Relay Output 1 = 1.0 (CLI "Open"); sensor 4 type 7 Power Input 1 = 1.0
        (CLI "Yes"); sensor 5 type 7 Power Input 2 = 0.0 (CLI "No")
  READ 0x1019 x5 (past sensor 5) -> EXCEPTION (illegal data address: exactly 5 sensors)
Per-step verdict (member 1): 1 PASS, 2 PASS, 3 PASS, 4 PASS, 5 PASS.

